c88c2","maturity":"draft","page_type":"entity","path":"pages/entities/potproject-code-agent-71b87d6c88c2.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":[],"title":"potproject/code-agent","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:32:22Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f6c2da5949ee4bedbb103db185eb4d23"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_064e9f75cff07110587e514b5ec13ca8d95d905fff135f81c873498350853852"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The action exposes inputs including github-token (required), event-path, and a timeout for AI processing defaulting to 600 seconds."},{"claim_ids":["clm_0c92274d6401d9ffb7b11c520453a78adea193cb8553307ba6a631f86183049f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Claude Code mode requires an anthropic-api-key input, while Codex mode requires an openai-api-key input, typically supplied from repository secrets."},{"claim_ids":["clm_1e0d72ca8f38b04f44b8d0792fd678d6ccacbb8a5fd4dfdb9f7fc5919819ce6d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Before running core logic, the action checks that the triggering user has write or admin permission on the repository."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7c4132ddb371e882f0ac42b6727153d36920cdbdc675520783c88e7f9177115f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Secrets such as the GitHub token, API keys, and AWS credentials are masked as *** in any output the action posts to GitHub."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b6c22cb8d58a465c4f994f555d9443d76c4ee20eb58e1e62737d783ab8b2e4c4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The action is triggered by /claude or /codex commands posted in GitHub Issues or Pull Request comments, which start Claude Code or Codex respectively."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c5fabc880ff7d347032c3e48fb91e460b324442dfd7dddb72a20ea7ca86d5469"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Codex mode supports an optional openai-base-url input to override the OpenAI API base URL."},{"claim_ids":["clm_cc250a920487ba5b685476dcf17cc710188bd70d678dc6a3c012ef443cf41c56"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The product depends on external AI CLIs, Claude Code by Anthropic and Codex by OpenAI, which it invokes on behalf of the user."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d2136fc581bc324dda620c8b510e5629c3fa3771ec054cc5e38910c98dce0720"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"When the AI modifies code, the action automatically creates a Pull Request or commits the changes; if no changes result, it posts the AI output as a comment instead."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e6663f7732baa53bb3594160ba5376605db4d9123bd1d97cb0f2f9a508101880"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Optional Claude Code inputs cover base URL, model selection, a small fast model for tasks like commit message generation, AWS Bedrock usage with AWS credentials, and disabling prompt caching."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e96fa3bdee1afca238fa91d99038f9300fc372641f7c76399b3df3ab2ca8901d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Setup requires repository workflow permissions for read/write access and allowing GitHub Actions to create and approve pull requests."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f2e158264533e9a18167909d159f61362cf7956e965129364841300a48304de9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The recommended workflow listens on issue opened, issue_comment created, and pull_request_review_comment created events, and skips runs triggered by bot senders."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ffc1dd6a7b4929c1e00fe3c61c4dbe643f46311de456cdbfe0758e5328389d4d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The tool appears aimed at automating code changes directly from GitHub conversations, with an example repository linked for issues and pull requests."}],"claim_ids":["clm_064e9f75cff07110587e514b5ec13ca8d95d905fff135f81c873498350853852","clm_0c92274d6401d9ffb7b11c520453a78adea193cb8553307ba6a631f86183049f","clm_1e0d72ca8f38b04f44b8d0792fd678d6ccacbb8a5fd4dfdb9f7fc5919819ce6d","clm_7c4132ddb371e882f0ac42b6727153d36920cdbdc675520783c88e7f9177115f","clm_b6c22cb8d58a465c4f994f555d9443d76c4ee20eb58e1e62737d783ab8b2e4c4","clm_c5fabc880ff7d347032c3e48fb91e460b324442dfd7dddb72a20ea7ca86d5469","clm_cc250a920487ba5b685476dcf17cc710188bd70d678dc6a3c012ef443cf41c56","clm_d2136fc581bc324dda620c8b510e5629c3fa3771ec054cc5e38910c98dce0720","clm_e6663f7732baa53bb3594160ba5376605db4d9123bd1d97cb0f2f9a508101880","clm_e96fa3bdee1afca238fa91d99038f9300fc372641f7c76399b3df3ab2ca8901d","clm_f2e158264533e9a18167909d159f61362cf7956e965129364841300a48304de9","clm_ffc1dd6a7b4929c1e